  "body": "Four bedrooms, generous outdoor space and a fantastic North Shore location!\r\n\r\nWelcome to 6 Flavia Close, a beautifully designed home built by Wolfbrook Residential, offering modern style, generous proportions and easy-care living just minutes from the beach.\r\n\r\nPositioned at the end of a boutique development of just four homes.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights:\r\n\r\n- 4 generous bedrooms, including master with ensuite and walk-in wardrobe\r\n- 2.5 modern bathrooms\r\n- 144.25m² floor area across two levels\r\n- 220m² freehold section\r\n- Single internal-access garage\r\n- Modern open-plan kitchen, dining and living\r\n- Quality Samsung kitchen appliances\r\n- Two heat pumps and double glazing\r\n- Fully fenced, landscaped outdoor area with private timber deck\r\n- Approximately 38.5m² of private outdoor living space\r\n- Healthy Homes compliant\r\n\r\nDesigned for Comfortable Living\r\n\r\nDownstairs, the modern kitchen flows seamlessly into the open-plan dining and living areas, connecting effortlessly with your private outdoor space. Perfect for entertaining, relaxing or spending time with family.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, four spacious bedrooms provide room for everyone, including a master suite with its own ensuite and walk-in wardrobe.\r\n\r\nA Coastal Location You'll Love\r\n\r\nEnjoy the best of North Shore living with everything close by:\r\n\r\n- Stredwick Reserve - 450m\r\n- Torbay Village - 2.5km\r\n- Waiake Beach - 3km\r\n- Long Bay Regional Park - 4km\r\n- Browns Bay Centre - 5km\r\n\r\nWith beaches, schools, shops, cafés and transport connections nearby, this location offers convenience and lifestyle in equal measure.\r\n\r\nFreehold, four bedrooms and internal-access garaging .\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your viewing!",
